WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.213
Behind every life saved during a disaster, there is no guesswork: only rigorous mathematics and applied physics.

2
00:00:07.563 --> 00:00:15.649
The Al-Hourani model calculates the exact probability of line-of-sight so drones hover at the optimal altitude for radio coverage.

3
00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:24.694
The lambda-two Fiedler eigenvalue mathematically guarantees the emergency mesh never splinters into isolated partitions.

4
00:00:25.044 --> 00:00:32.703
Meanwhile, Deygout knife-edge diffraction computes how radio waves bend over mountain ridges and buildings in Valencia and Bejís.

5
00:00:34.303 --> 00:00:40.361
Verifiable science, open codebase, and reliable technology available when every second counts.

6
00:00:40.711 --> 00:00:47.986
Inspect the mathematical live computations at civic-relay-investor dot vercel dot app slash senda.
